        <mxCell id="171" value="Strip-row entry: the top row injects x into PELeft.in_n and drives PERight.in_n to zero.&#xa;Strip-row exit: the visible strip output is taken from the bottom PERight reg_s of each strip.&#xa;This is why PELeft forwards x on out_s while PELeft.out_right_p / PERight.out_left_b stay local to the pair." style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E5E7EB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;align=left;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
